<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 28.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 28	Nov 27	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  241.200     239.920     237.040    1.75 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.740     303.160     303.640    0.03 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.530     157.260     165.490   -4.81 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.432	46.440	48.410   -4.09 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  405.100     401.300     366.280   10.60 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.470     140.170     147.886   -5.01 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.952	15.844	14.975    6.52 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.680     211.630     230.135   -7.58 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.871	 1.869	 1.939   -3.51 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.560	 1.557	 1.575   -0.95 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.320     185.805     206.030   -9.57 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
